# RS3 Banned Titles
# -----------------
# Titles matching any line here will be skipped entirely — no splitting,
# no Last.fm lookup, no Shazam API call.
#
# FORMAT:
#   - One entry per line.
#   - Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#   - Prefix a line with "re:" to treat it as a Python regex (case-insensitive).
#   - Everything else is matched as a case-insensitive substring.
#
# EXAMPLES:
#   AD BREAK                         ← skips any title containing "AD BREAK"
#   re:^ADVERT\b                     ← skips titles starting with "ADVERT"
#   re:CONTINUE\s+TO\s+PLAY          ← skips "CONTINUE TO PLAY" with any spacing
#
# Add your station-specific banners below. When a new station throws
# a weird ad title at you, just add a line here — no code changes needed.
# The file is re-read on every title change, so edits are picked up live.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Generic ad/break patterns
AD BREAK
ADVERT
re:(?:THIS\s+)?STATION\s+WILL\s+CONTINUE\s+TO\s+PLAY
re:^COMMERCIAL\s+BREAK
re:^BREAK\s*$
SPONSOR
re:^PROMO\b
re:^PSA\b
re:^ID/PSA$

# Station-name / branding noise (no artist - title split)
Broadcasting LIVE
SomaFM ID
re:^Radio\s+Gorzow$
bedroom-dj.co.uk
